Package: compress-images
Version: VERSION
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: rokmiksic
Homepage: https://github.com/rokmiksic/compress-images
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, imagemagick, ffmpeg, libheif1
